      ( ( Q - R ) / ( P - R ) ) ) ) < 0 ) -> ( ( ( S - R ) / ( Q - P ) ) x. ( Q - P ) ) = ( -u ( ( S
      - R ) / ( Q - P ) ) x. -u ( Q - P ) ) )
